# Grouping & Sections Implementation Plan

## Goal
Implement visual grouping of images by Date (Day/Month) in [ScrollBench](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/src/ScrollBenchImageModel.h#26-27).
Using `GridView`'s native `section` property is the most efficient approach.

## Proposed Changes

### [MODIFY] [ScrollBenchImageModel.h](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/src/ScrollBenchImageModel.h)
- Add `SectionRole` enum.
- Update `SimpleDate` struct or generation logic to ensure test data has spread-out dates.

### [MODIFY] [ScrollBenchImageModel.cpp](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/src/ScrollBenchImageModel.cpp)
